-- Arithmetic on a string that arrived through `any` can only be caught when
-- it runs. Expected: "cannot use `*` on a `string` and an `integer`", with a
-- help line showing the `as integer` conversion.
-- Pinned in crates/saule-vm/tests/runtime_diagnostics.rs.
local a: any = "x"
local b: any = a * 2
println(b)
